diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4479b53..4ede451 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -9,6 +9,15 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+Visited page contents stay mounted across Astro client navigations. The cache in
+`src/scripts/view-cache.ts` keeps at most five views (including the active view),
+keyed by pathname and query string, and evicts the least recently used view.
+Inactive views use `content-visibility: hidden` and `inert`; browsers without
+content visibility fall back to `display: none`. Astro still fetches destinations
+and manages page metadata, history, and scroll restoration. Reloading clears the
+cache. Set `cacheView={false}` on `Layout` to opt a page out, as the sign-in and
+sign-up pages do so credential forms are discarded on departure.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
